# Signing. Two keystores are committed ON PURPOSE (keystore/README.md says why):
#   - keystore/debug.keystore, the shared debug key, for good;
#   - keystore/temporary-release.keystore, a stand-in release key, only until the real one
#     is in GitHub Secrets, then deleted.
# The real release key must NEVER enter the repo, whatever its extension.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
!keystore/debug.keystore
!keystore/temporary-release.keystore

# Logs and profiling
*.log
*.hprof

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
